        "original_id": "061199be-5e4e-52ce-8231-cf2e09f95a9c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Rudd, Mark Evans\n- Bands: AC/DC, Buster Brown\n- Albums: Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap\n- Topics: band membership changes\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, AC/DC released its third LP, Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap, in Australia and Europe.\n- Mark Evans played bass guitar on AC/DC's third LP, Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap.\n- After Mark Evans left AC/DC, Phil Rudd became the band's only Australian-born member.\n- Phil Rudd was a drummer in the Australian band Buster Brown.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
